OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785070071
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FPassengers at Gatwick airport have no
OL,7,Faccess to working toilets or bars and
OL,8,Frestaurants because of a water supply
OL,9,Ffailure.
OL,11,FAlthough flights are unaffected,
OL,12,Fseveral services have been compromised
OL,13,Fat both of the airport's terminals,
OL,14,Fwith passengers posting online that
OL,15,Fthey are unable to get hot drinks,
OL,16,Fwash their hands or fill up water
OL,17,Fbottles.
OL,19,FIt comes after a power outage at a
OL,20,Fnearby treatment works.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/4
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
