FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785070071
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FThe airport apologised in a post on X
OL,7,Fon Saturday, in which it said an issue
OL,8,Fin the Horley area was causing
OL,9,Fdisruption at the airport, with water
OL,10,Fsupply affected in both terminals.
OL,12,FIt said passengers and staff were
OL,13,Fbeing supplied with bottled water and
OL,14,Fadded that "contingency measures are
OL,15,Fbeing put in place to ensure the
OL,16,Fwelfare of our passengers".
OL,18,FIt said the situation was "under
OL,19,Finvestigation".
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/4
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
