OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785070071
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,FSES Water, which supplies parts of
OL,7,FSurrey, Kent and South London, said
OL,8,Fthe problem had been caused by a power
OL,9,Foutage at Bough Beech Water Treatment
OL,10,FWorks in Kent.
OL,12,FA spokesperson said: "Due to a number
OL,13,Fof complications caused by power
OL,14,Foutage at our Bough Beech Water
OL,15,FTreatment Works, some customers are
OL,16,Fexperiencing low water pressure or a
OL,17,Ftemporary loss of supply.
OL,19,F"We are working to overcome those
OL,20,Fcomplications and return the treatment
OL,21,Fworks to supply as quickly as we can.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/4
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
