OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1785070071
OL,3,CWater supply outage leaves Gatwick
OL,4,Cpassengers with no working toilets
OL,6,F"Gatwick Airport is being affected but
OL,7,Fwe are working with them while our
OL,8,Fteams work to restore normal service
OL,9,Fas quickly as possible.
OL,11,F"We thank customers and our partners
OL,12,Fat Gatwick Airport for their patience."
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/4
